# Game Catalog API

The Game Catalog API provides catalog metadata, sales reporting, user profiles, feedback, and administrative catalog operations.

## Product rules

- Catalog metadata is public.
- Sales figures are available to paid accounts.
- Catalog changes are limited to administrators.
- Users can view and update their own profiles.

## Run locally

Install the dependencies and start Uvicorn:

```bash
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn main:app --reload
```

The API listens at `http://127.0.0.1:8000`. Interactive API documentation is available at the root path.

## Main endpoints

- `GET /games`
- `GET /games/{game_id}/sales`
- `POST /games`
- `PUT /games/{game_id}`
- `GET /search`
- `POST /login`
- `GET /users`
- `GET /user_profile`
- `POST /update_profile`
- `POST /feedback`
- `GET /fetch_url`
- `GET /redirect`
